          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गिरफ़्तार करना — giraftār karnā — \"to arrest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर पुलिस उसे गिरफ़्तार करेगी तो वह जेल जाएगा। agar pulis use giraftār karegī to vah jel jāegā. If the police arrest him, he will go to prison."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने चोर को गिरफ़्तार किया, usne cor ko giraftār kiyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गिरफ़्तार करना (giraftār karnā) is Persian giriftār, \"seized, taken captive\", usually traced to the Persian verb for taking hold, with करना. The person arrested takes को: चोर को गिरफ़्तार किया."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
